  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When using sendChange on a synced variable, the owner and remote clients will have inconsistent results when the variables remains the same:\nThe owner will activate the Change event for that variable every time regardless if the variable was actually changed, whereas remote clients will only activate the Change event if the variable has actually changed.\nAttached is a picture of an example graph for testing the problem, where every 2 seconds the SyncedInt is changed to the number 7. The results will be that the owner will print 7 to the log every 2 seconds, but remote clients will only print it once (because the value is changed from 0 to 7 initially)",
